 "layout": "<div class=\"booklet\"><p style=\"margin-bottom:2px\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#127D80;font-size:9pt\">A2 KEY · MOCK FINAL</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:6px\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#0B5456;font-size:20pt\">Listening</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;color:#6E6E6E;font-size:10pt\">Four parts, twenty questions. You will hear every part twice. Answer every question — a wrong answer costs nothing.</span></p><table class=\"bk\"><tr><td style=\"background:#F2F8F8;border:1px solid #127D80;padding:12px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 6px\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#0B5456;font-size:11pt\">The recording</span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:#6E6E6E\">Put your headphones on and press play. Every part is heard twice on the recording, so do not go back to the beginning.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:#6E6E6E\">Listening, track 99.05</span></p></td></tr></table><table class=\"bk\"><tr><td style=\"background:#127D80;width:92px;border:0;vertical-align:middle\"><p style=\"text-align:center;margin:0\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#fff;font-size:11pt\">PART 1</span></p></td><td style=\"border:0;border-bottom:1px solid #127D80;vertical-align:middle\"><p style=\"margin:0\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#0B5456;font-size:11pt\">Questions 1–5 · five short conversations</span></p></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;color:#6E6E6E;font-size:10pt\">You will hear five short conversations. For each question, choose A, B or C.</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:6px;padding-left:16px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:10pt\">1</span> <span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">What is the man going to wear?</span> <span data-mcq=\"1\"></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:6px;padding-left:16px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:10pt\">2</span> <span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">What time does the lesson begin?</span> <span data-mcq=\"2\"></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:6px;padding-left:16px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:10pt\">3</span> <span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Which animal did they see?</span> <span data-mcq=\"3\"></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:6px;padding-left:16px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:10pt\">4</span> <span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">How much money did he spend?</span> <span data-mcq=\"4\"></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:6px;padding-left:16px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:10pt\">5</span> <span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Who is ill?</span> <span data-mcq=\"5\"></span></p><table class=\"bk\"><tr><td style=\"background:#127D80;width:92px;border:0;vertical-align:middle\"><p style=\"text-align:center;margin:0\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#fff;font-size:11pt\">PART 2</span></p></td><td style=\"border:0;border-bottom:1px solid #127D80;vertical-align:middle\"><p style=\"margin:0\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#0B5456;font-size:11pt\">Questions 6–10 · who does what</span></p></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;color:#6E6E6E;font-size:10pt\">Listen to Yusuf telling a friend about the presents his family gave him. What did each person give him? For questions 6 to 10, write a letter A to H next to each person.</span></p><table class=\"bk\"><tr><td style=\"background:#F2F8F8;border:1px solid #127D80;padding:10px 12px\"><p style=\"margin-bottom:4px\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><b>A</b> &nbsp;a watch</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:4px\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><b>B</b> &nbsp;a book</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:4px\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><b>C</b> &nbsp;money</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:4px\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><b>D</b> &nbsp;a football shirt</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:4px\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><b>E</b> &nbsp;a cake</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:4px\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><b>F</b> &nbsp;gloves</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:4px\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><b>G</b> &nbsp;a photograph</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:4px\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><b>H</b> &nbsp;a plant</span></p></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin-bottom:6px;padding-left:16px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:10pt\">6</span> <span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">His mother</span> <span data-mcq=\"6\"></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:6px;padding-left:16px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:10pt\">7</span> <span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">His father</span> <span data-mcq=\"7\"></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:6px;padding-left:16px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:10pt\">8</span> <span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">His sister</span> <span data-mcq=\"8\"></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:6px;padding-left:16px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:10pt\">9</span> <span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">His grandmother</span> <span data-mcq=\"9\"></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:6px;padding-left:16px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:10pt\">10</span> <span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">His friend Tim</span> <span data-mcq=\"10\"></span></p><table class=\"bk\"><tr><td style=\"background:#127D80;width:92px;border:0;vertical-align:middle\"><p style=\"text-align:center;margin:0\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#fff;font-size:11pt\">PART 3</span></p></td><td style=\"border:0;border-bottom:1px solid #127D80;vertical-align:middle\"><p style=\"margin:0\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#0B5456;font-size:11pt\">Questions 11–15 · a longer conversation</span></p></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;color:#6E6E6E;font-size:10pt\">Listen to a woman asking about a bicycle in a shop. For questions 11 to 15, tick A, B or C.</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:6px;padding-left:16px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:10pt\">11</span> <span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">The woman wa